     NovoPen 6 / Echo Plus (inv. 29, docs/29-novopen.md): an NFC Forum Type 4 tag, so Android reports IsoDep + NfcA + Ndef.
     All three must match: EMV bank and transit cards are IsoDep + NfcA/NfcB without Ndef, the Libre sensor is NfcV only.
     pen/PenTag checks the Type 4 tag again before reading. -->
<resources xmlns:xliff="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2">
    <tech-list>
        <tech>android.nfc.tech.IsoDep</tech>
        <tech>android.nfc.tech.NfcA</tech>
        <tech>android.nfc.tech.Ndef</tech>
    </tech-list>
</resources>
